{#
Admin panel chrome, shared by _live_frame and _db_frame (each used to carry its
own copy of card_open).

Cards are native <details>: collapsing needs no JavaScript, and the summary is
keyboard-operable and screen-reader-labelled for free. The Stimulus controller
only persists the state — if it fails or never loads, the panel still opens and
closes, it just forgets.

Collapsed state is stored per user, server-side, so it survives a new browser.
Panels are keyed by a stable slug, and the *collapsed* set is what is stored —
so a panel added later defaults to open without backfilling anyone's settings.

A collapsed card still answers its own question: `status` is a short summary of
what is inside — "2 down", "14 waiting" — shown only while the card is shut, so
a collapsed dashboard is still a dashboard rather than a list of headings. It is
hidden when open, where the body says the same thing in full. `tone` colours it:
'warn' or 'danger' for a summary that should be noticed from across the room.

Usage:
    {% import 'admin/_cards.html.twig' as cards %}
    {{ cards.open('fa-heart-pulse', 'Processes'|trans, 'processes', collapsedPanels, '2 down', 'danger') }}
        …body…
    {{ cards.close() }}
#}

{% macro open(icon, title, key, collapsedPanels, status = null, tone = null) %}
    <details
        {#
        Grid items stretch by default, so a collapsed card sitting beside an
        open one kept the open one's height — a 40px summary in a 400px
        outline. align-self only while shut: two open cards side by side still
        line up.
        #}
        class="group/card rounded-pane border border-line bg-pane-soft overflow-hidden
               [&:not([open])]:self-start"
        {% if key not in collapsedPanels %}open{% endif %}
        data-controller="admin--admin-panel"
        data-admin--admin-panel-key-value="{{ key }}"
        data-admin--admin-panel-url-value="{{ path('app_admin_panel_toggle') }}"
        data-admin--admin-panel-csrf-value="{{ csrf_token('admin_panel_' ~ key) }}"
        data-action="toggle->admin--admin-panel#persist"
    >
        <summary class="flex items-center gap-2.5 px-5 h-11 border-b border-line cursor-pointer list-none
                        hover:bg-hover transition-colors select-none">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right text-[9px] text-ink-faint w-3 shrink-0
                      transition-transform group-open/card:rotate-90" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid {{ icon }} text-xs text-zinc-400" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">{{ title }}</h2>
            {% if status is not null %}
                <span class="ml-auto min-w-0 truncate text-xs group-open/card:hidden
                             {{ tone == 'danger' ? 'text-danger' : (tone == 'warn' ? 'text-warning' : 'text-ink-faint') }}">
                    {{ status }}
                </span>
            {% endif %}
        </summary>
{% endmacro %}

{% macro close() %}
    </details>
{% endmacro %}
